---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';


---

<Layout title="Reserva online | Fisio Clinical" description="Reserva online de fisioterapia con seleccion de hueco y confirmacion inmediata.">
  <main class="booking-shell">
    <section class="booking-hero">
      <div class="booking-hero-copy">
        <span class="booking-kicker">Reserva online</span>
        <h1>Una reserva clara, rapida y sin friccion.</h1>
        <p id="clinicLead">Selecciona un dia, elige un hueco disponible y deja tus datos para confirmar la cita.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="booking-hero-card">
        <div class="booking-clinic-line">
          <span class="material-symbols-rounded">calendar_today</span>
          <div>
            <strong id="clinicName">Fisio Clinical</strong>
            <p id="clinicLocation">Terrassa, Barcelona</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="booking-clinic-line">
          <span class="material-symbols-rounded">person</span>
          <div>
            <strong id="professionalName">Cargando profesional...</strong>
            <p id="professionalMeta">Agenda sincronizada con Google Calendar</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="booking-clinic-line" id="clinicContactRow" hidden>
          <span class="material-symbols-rounded">call</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Contacto</strong>
            <p id="clinicContact"></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="booking-rhythm">
        <article>
          <span>1</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Elige el dia</strong>
            <p>Solo veras fechas dentro de la ventana abierta para reservas.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span>2</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Selecciona un hueco real</strong>
            <p>Los huecos se cruzan con la agenda activa y sus bloqueos reales.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span>3</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Confirma tus datos</strong>
            <p>Registramos la cita y la dejamos reflejada en el CRM y en Calendar.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="booking-panel">
      <div class="booking-panel-head">
        <div>
          <span class="booking-kicker">Paso a paso</span>
          <h2>Reservar cita</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="booking-badge" id="bookingTimezone">Europe/Madrid</div>
      </div>

      <div class="booking-grid">
        <label class="booking-field booking-field-date">
          <span>Dia</span>
          <input id="bookingDate" type="date" />
        </label>

        <div class="booking-field booking-field-slots">
          <div class="booking-field-head">
            <span>Huecos disponibles</span>
            <small id="bookingWindowHint">Cargando horarios...</small>
          </div>
          <div id="slotsState" class="booking-inline-note" role="status">Selecciona un dia para ver horas disponibles.</div>
          <div id="slotsGrid" class="slots-grid"></div>
        </div>

        <form id="bookingForm" class="booking-form">
          <div class="booking-form-grid">
            <label class="booking-field">
              <span>Nombre y apellidos</span>
              <input id="patientNameInput" type="text" placeholder="Ej. Laura Gomez" required />
            </label>
            <label class="booking-field">
              <span>Telefono</span>
              <input id="patientPhoneInput" type="tel" placeholder="600 123 123" />
            </label>
            <label class="booking-field booking-field-wide">
              <span>Email</span>
              <input id="patientEmailInput" type="email" placeholder="tu@email.com" />
            </label>
            <label class="booking-field booking-field-wide">
              <span>Motivo de la consulta</span>
              <textarea id="bookingReasonInput" rows="4" placeholder="Cuanto mejor expliques la dolencia o el objetivo de la cita, mejor preparado queda el caso."></textarea>
            </label>
          </div>

          <div class="booking-summary" id="bookingSummary">
            <strong>Sin hueco seleccionado</strong>
            <p>Elige primero una fecha y una hora para continuar.</p>
          </div>

          <p id="bookingFeedback" class="booking-feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>

          <div class="booking-actions">
            <button id="bookingSubmitBtn" class="booking-submit" type="submit" disabled>Confirmar reserva</button>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="bookingSuccess" class="booking-success" tabindex="-1" hidden>
      <span class="booking-kicker">Reserva registrada</span>
      <h2>Cita creada correctamente</h2>
      <p id="bookingSuccessText">Tu hueco ha quedado guardado. Si necesitas cambiarlo, contacta con la clinica.</p>
      <button id="bookingResetBtn" type="button" class="booking-reset">Reservar otra cita</button>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script src="../scripts/public-booking.js"></script>

  <style>
    :root {
      --booking-bg: #f4f7fb;
      --booking-surface: #ffffff;
      --booking-border: #dce3ed;
      --booking-ink: #142234;
      --booking-muted: #536375;
      --booking-accent: #175dd0;
      --booking-accent-soft: #eaf1fe;
      --booking-highlight: #eaf1fe;
      --booking-danger: #b42318;
      --booking-shadow: none;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      min-height: 100dvh;
      background: var(--booking-bg);
      color: var(--booking-ink);
      font-family: var(--font-family-base);
    }

    .booking-shell {
      min-height: 100vh;
      min-height: 100dvh;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(320px, 0.92fr) minmax(320px, 1.08fr);
      gap: clamp(1.25rem, 2vw, 2.5rem);
      padding: clamp(1.25rem, 2vw, 2rem);
      align-items: stretch;
    }

    .booking-hero,
    .booking-panel,
    .booking-success {
      position: relative;
      border: 1px solid var(--booking-border);
      border-radius: 32px;
      background: var(--booking-surface);
      box-shadow: var(--booking-shadow);
      backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .booking-hero {
      padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 3rem);
      display: grid;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      align-content: start;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(23, 93, 208, 0.18), transparent 34%),
        radial-gradient(circle at bottom left, rgba(23, 93, 208, 0.24), transparent 28%),
        rgba(255, 252, 246, 0.9);
    }

    .booking-kicker {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.45rem;
      font-size: 0.76rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--booking-accent);
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .booking-hero h1,
    .booking-panel h2,
    .booking-success h2 {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: var(--font-family-base);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      line-height: 0.96;
    }

    .booking-hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 5.5rem);
      max-width: 10ch;
    }

    .booking-hero p,
    .booking-rhythm p,
    .booking-clinic-line p,
    .booking-summary p,
    .booking-success p,
    .booking-inline-note,
    .booking-feedback,
    .booking-field small {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--booking-muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .booking-hero-card {
      display: grid;
      gap: 1rem;
      padding: 1.15rem;
      border-radius: 24px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.62);
      border: 1px solid rgba(23, 93, 208, 0.1);
    }

    .booking-clinic-line {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 44px 1fr;
      gap: 0.9rem;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .booking-clinic-line .material-symbols-rounded {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--booking-accent) 10%, white);
      color: var(--booking-accent);
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }

    .booking-clinic-line strong,
    .booking-rhythm strong,
    .booking-summary strong,
    .slot-pill strong {
      display: block;
      color: var(--booking-ink);
    }

    .booking-rhythm {
      display: grid;
      gap: 0.9rem;
    }

    .booking-rhythm article {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 34px 1fr;
      gap: 0.9rem;
      align-items: start;
      padding: 0.7rem 0;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(20, 34, 52, 0.08);
    }

    .booking-rhythm article:first-child {
      border-top: 0;
      padding-top: 0;
    }

    .booking-rhythm span {
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--booking-ink);
      color: #f8f5ef;
      font-size: 0.84rem;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .booking-panel,
    .booking-success {
      padding: clamp(1.35rem, 2.5vw, 2.4rem);
    }

    .booking-panel-head {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: start;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .booking-panel h2,
    .booking-success h2 {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 3rem);
    }

    .booking-badge {
      padding: 0.65rem 0.9rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--booking-accent-soft);
      color: var(--booking-accent);
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .booking-grid {
      display: grid;
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }

    .booking-field {
      display: grid;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .booking-field > span,
    .booking-field-head span {
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--booking-ink) 82%, white);
    }

    .booking-field input,
    .booking-field textarea {
      width: 100%;
      border: 1px solid rgba(20, 34, 52, 0.12);
      border-radius: 18px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
      padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
      font: inherit;
      color: var(--booking-ink);
      outline: none;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      transition: border-color 180ms ease, transform 180ms ease, box-shadow 180ms ease;
    }

    .booking-field input:focus,
    .booking-field textarea:focus {
      border-color: rgba(23, 93, 208, 0.5);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(23, 93, 208, 0.1);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .booking-field-head {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1rem;
      align-items: baseline;
    }

    .booking-field-head small {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--booking-muted);
    }

    .booking-inline-note {
      padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: rgba(20, 34, 52, 0.04);
      border: 1px dashed rgba(20, 34, 52, 0.14);
      font-size: 0.96rem;
    }

    .slots-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(132px, 1fr));
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    :global(#slotsGrid .slot-pill) {
      border: 1px solid rgba(20, 34, 52, 0.12);
      border-radius: 20px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.84);
      color: var(--booking-ink);
      padding: 0.95rem 1rem;
      text-align: left;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform 180ms ease, border-color 180ms ease, background 180ms ease, box-shadow 180ms ease;
    }

    :global(#slotsGrid .slot-pill span) {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 0.25rem;
      color: var(--booking-muted);
      font-size: 0.86rem;
    }

    :global(#slotsGrid .slot-pill:hover),
    :global(#slotsGrid .slot-pill:focus-visible) {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      border-color: rgba(23, 93, 208, 0.3);
      box-shadow: 0 16px 32px rgba(20, 34, 52, 0.08);
      outline: none;
    }

    :global(#slotsGrid .slot-pill.is-selected) {
      background: var(--booking-accent-soft);
      border-color: rgba(23, 93, 208, 0.45);
    }

    .booking-form {
      display: grid;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .booking-form-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .booking-field-wide {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }

    .booking-summary {
      padding: 1rem 1.05rem;
      border-radius: 20px;
      background: var(--booking-accent-soft);
      border: 1px solid rgba(23, 93, 208, 0.12);
    }

    .booking-feedback {
      padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 16px;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
    }

    .booking-feedback[data-state='error'] {
      background: rgba(180, 35, 24, 0.08);
      color: var(--booking-danger);
      border-color: rgba(180, 35, 24, 0.14);
    }

    .booking-feedback[data-state='success'] {
      background: rgba(23, 93, 208, 0.08);
      color: var(--booking-accent);
      border-color: rgba(23, 93, 208, 0.14);
    }

    .booking-actions {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: flex-start;
    }

    .booking-submit,
    .booking-reset {
      appearance: none;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 1rem 1.35rem;
      font: inherit;
      font-weight: 800;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform 180ms ease, opacity 180ms ease, box-shadow 180ms ease;
    }

    .booking-submit {
      background: var(--booking-accent);
      color: #f8f5ef;
      box-shadow: none;
    }

    .booking-submit:disabled {
      opacity: 0.45;
      cursor: not-allowed;
      box-shadow: none;
    }

    .booking-submit:not(:disabled):hover,
    .booking-reset:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .booking-reset {
      background: rgba(20, 34, 52, 0.08);
      color: var(--booking-ink);
    }

    .booking-success {
      display: grid;
      align-content: center;
      gap: 1rem;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(23, 93, 208, 0.14), transparent 26%),
        radial-gradient(circle at bottom right, rgba(23, 93, 208, 0.18), transparent 28%),
        rgba(255, 252, 246, 0.9);
    }

    @media (max-width: 1080px) {
      .booking-shell {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .booking-hero h1 {
        max-width: 12ch;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .booking-shell {
        padding: 1rem;
      }

      .booking-hero,
      .booking-panel,
      .booking-success {
        border-radius: 24px;
      }

      .booking-panel-head,
      .booking-field-head {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
      }

      .booking-form-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .slots-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 520px) {
      .booking-hero h1,
      .booking-panel h2,
      .booking-success h2 {
        letter-spacing: -0.05em;
      }

      .slots-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .booking-submit,
      .booking-reset {
        width: 100%;
      }
    }
  </style>
</Layout>
